##Implement and maintain state##
terraform show ===> show the state file.
terraform state -help.
terraform state show aws_instance.web ===> show the state of the resource and it's attributes. 
terraform state pull ===> pull the state file from the remote backend.
terraform state rm aws_instance.web ===> remove the resource from the state file.
terraform state list ===> list of resources.
terraform.tfstate => terraform state file.
terraform appl -lock-timeout=20s.
terraform apply -lock=true: Enables state locking for the apply operation (default behavior).
terraform plan -lock=true: Enables state locking for the plan operation (default behavior).
terraform state unlock: Manually unlocks the state if it gets stuck.
terraform state mv aws_instance.web aws_instance.web2 ===> move the resource from one to another.
terraform state replace-provider registry.terraform.io/hashicorp/aws registry.terraform.io/hashicorp/aws.


